  "description": "Current turn-around for a frameset is 8-10, a complete bike is 10-12 weeks until shipment. This could be extended depending on options chosen. Please ask.\n\nFEATURES AND INFORMATION\nDesigned And Developed By Milwaukee Bicycle Co. - Handmade By Waterford Precision Cycles.\nTUBING\nThe Track geometry; features the race-tight, legendary track geometry and embodies a rich history and proven, pinpoint design.. The Track Frame consists of dynamic THRMLX steel tubing. Vari-Wall THERMLX is the ONLY steel in the industry manufactured to AMS Aerospace Standards.\nPART INTEGRATION SPECS\n68mm Threaded Bottom Bracket Shell\n1.5 - 1-1/8\" Headtube\nNO Rear Caliper Compatibility\nCustom Laser Cut Rear Dropouts\nBRAKE CABLE ROUTING\nN/A\nSTOCK DERAILLEUR ROUTING\nN/A\nBRAZE-ONS\nNO Water Bottle Bosses\nStainless Steel Milwaukee Headbadge, Milwaukee Script And WI State Badges\nFront Brake Compatible",
